ificate. They differ in how deep the review goes, who makes the final call, and how the broker gets the fix back to you. That's where the best COI tracking software for your company gets decided.</strong></p>\n        <p style=\"margin:8px 0 0\">✅ <strong>Forsured is built around requirements that change by project and a shared workspace where the broker sees what's missing. PINS Advantage goes deepest on endorsement wording inside Procore. bcs publishes per-vendor rates and has a free tier. Certificial gets live policy data from the agent.</strong></p>\n        <p style=\"margin:8px 0 0\">✅ <strong>For Procore COI tracking, Billy, bcs, Jones, PINS Advantage, TrustLayer and illumend (under the myCOI name) are on the Procore Marketplace. Forsured's Procore integration is open to early access customers, and Certificial doesn't list one.</strong></p>\n        <p style=\"margin:8px 0 0\">✅ <strong>Published COI tracking software pricing runs from free tiers (Certificial up to 5 suppliers, bcs up to 25 vendors, TrustLayer up to 50) to about $300 a month at PINS Advantage. Forsured, Jones and illumend quote on request.</strong></p>\n      </td></tr>\n    </table>\n  </td></tr>\n  <tr><td align=\"left\" style=\"padding:24px 32px 0\">\n    <table role=\"presentation\" cellpadding=\"0\" cellspacing=\"0\" border=\"0\"><tr>\n      <td bgcolor=\"#FB612A\" style=\"background-color:#FB612A;border-radius:8px\"><a href=\"https://forsured.ai/blog/best-coi-tracking-software-construction/?utm_source=email&amp;utm_medium=subscriber&amp;utm_campaign=blog\" style=\"display:inline-block;padding:12px 22px;font-family:Inter,Arial,Helvetica,sans-serif;font-size:15px;font-weight:600;color:#ffffff;text-decoration:none\">Read the full post →</a></td>\n    </tr></table>\n  </td></tr>\n  <tr><td style=\"padding:28px 32px 0;font-family:Inter,Arial,Helvetica,sans-serif;font-size:16px;line-height:1.6;color:#0A0A0E\">\n    <p style=\"margin:0\">Questions, or a COI you want a second set of eyes on? Just hit reply. It comes straight to me.</p>\n    <p style=\"margin:16px 0 0\"><strong>Zach Servideo</strong><br/><span style=\"color:#555555;font-size:14px\">Founder / CGO<br/>Forsured</span></p>\n  </td></tr>\n  <tr><td style=\"padding:28px 32px 24px;font-family:Inter,Arial,Helvetica,sans-serif;font-size:12px;line-height:1.6;color:#555555;border-top:1px solid #E4E7EC\">\n    <p style=\"margin:20px 0 0\">You're getting this because you signed up for new posts on the <a href=\"https://forsured.ai/blog/?utm_source=email&amp;utm_medium=subscriber&amp;utm_campaign=blog\" style=\"color:#555555\">Forsured blog</a>. Not for you anymore? Reply \"stop\" and I'll take you off.</p>\n  </td></tr>\n</table>\n</td></tr>\n</table>\n</body>\n</html>\n"
